    {
      "text": "A table titled \"EPI: AEFI cases - this and last 5 years\" for Trainingland; the year headings are too blurred to read, and the first two columns are empty. The four columns with data give suspected non-serious AEFI cases 335, 361, 352, 342; suspected serious 51, 72, 80, 62; and totals 386, 433, 432, 404.",
